l the rubbish  in between and I'm only focusing on the  good value Brands so just like YouTube  being able to supplement five figures  per year these brand deals are now also  bringing in an additional five figures  per year what I also noticed is as the  subscribers grow so does the actual  community so a long time ago as I  started this journey I created a Discord  group for all Architects architecture  students and anybody in between to join  chat and collaborate completely free the  link is down below if you want to join  it but what this community quickly  provided me with was the ability to  provide my expertise to them as they  learn and as they evolve in their career  which then ended up resulting in my next  stream of passive income and that was  digital downloads on the architectural  space in my website I have a series of  digital downloads and I used to have  many many more in the past I took them  down redeveloped them and focused on the  key ones that were of interest to  everybody in the architecture Community  these digital downloads took me a very  long time to create but now that they're  created they're up on the website  they're available to download and it  doesn't take any more of my time so  after about six months this slowly  started to actually become profitable  and now after a year it is very  profitable and I'm very happy that I  started the digital download space on  the website as of about a week ago I  also started in the physical product  realm in the e-commerce store so now I'm  able to offer physical tangible products  that people are able to pay for and get  something in return rather than a  digital asset that they may not find  Value in again these physical products  took a very long time to develop they  took a lot of thought care creation and  testing sampling over and over again  until we got them perfectly right but  eventually we were able to put them all  together and put them online for  everybody to enjoy like I said it's